<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Jan-April consolidated net 965 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telebras Jan-April consolidated net 965 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications firm Telebras released the following preliminary consolidated financial results for the January-April period.</p>
<p>		   Jan-April 1997     Jan-April 1996</p>
<p>Net		    965 million	     N/A</p>
<p>Holding Net	1.145 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Net Oper Revs    4.693 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Oper Profit	1.733 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Profit   1.631 bln	     N/A</p>
<p>Note: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totalled 28.818 billion reais in the January-April period.</p>
<p>It also said installed fixed lines reached 15.4 million, while cellular terminals totalled 2.72 million in the period.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
